{
  "workflow_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000304",
  "version": 1,
  "definition": {
    "title": "Gym 003 - Apply reviewed firewall rule",
    "description": "Runs deterministic serialized rule application, activation checks, attack/benign retests, evidence collection, and rollback. Managed by Gym 003.",
    "entrypoint": {
      "ref": "apply_reviewed_rule",
      "expects": {
        "case_id": {"type": "str", "description": "Managed Tracecat case UUID"},
        "task_id": {"type": "str", "description": "Injected case task UUID", "default": "not-a-task"},
        "scenario": {"type": "enum['supplier-intake']", "description": "Fixed server-side scenario"},
        "proposal_revision": {"type": "int", "description": "Reviewed proposal revision"},
        "mode": {"type": "enum['BLOCK', 'LOG_ONLY']", "description": "Requested deterministic rule mode"}
      }
    },
    "config": {"timeout": 210},
    "actions": [
      {
        "ref": "apply_reviewed_rule",
        "action": "core.http_request",
        "args": {
          "url": "http://test-api:8080/v1/jobs",
          "method": "POST",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": "Bearer ${{ SECRETS.gym_003_test_api.TOKEN }}",
            "Content-Type": "application/json"
          },
          "payload": {
            "kind": "apply_rule",
            "scenario": "supplier-intake",
            "case_id": "${{ TRIGGER.case_id }}",
            "proposal_revision": "${{ TRIGGER.proposal_revision }}",
            "mode": "${{ TRIGGER.mode }}"
          },
          "timeout": 10
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": "wait_for_rule_application",
        "action": "core.http_poll",
        "depends_on": ["apply_reviewed_rule"],
        "args": {
          "url": "http://test-api:8080/v1/jobs/${{ ACTIONS.apply_reviewed_rule.result.data.run_id }}",
          "method": "GET",
          "headers": {"Authorization": "Bearer ${{ SECRETS.gym_003_test_api.TOKEN }}"},
          "timeout": 10,
          "poll_interval": 2,
          "poll_max_attempts": 90,
          "poll_condition": "lambda response: response['data'].get('status') in ['completed', 'inconclusive', 'failed', 'cancelled', 'timed_out']"
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": "record_rule_result",
        "action": "core.cases.create_comment",
        "depends_on": ["wait_for_rule_application"],
        "args": {
          "case_id": "${{ TRIGGER.case_id }}",
          "content": "## Gym 003 firewall task result\n\n- Task: `${{ TRIGGER.task_id }}`\n- Execution: `${{ ENV.workflow.execution_id }}`\n- Run: `${{ ACTIONS.wait_for_rule_application.result.data.run_id }}`\n- Proposal revision: `${{ TRIGGER.proposal_revision }}`\n- Requested mode: `${{ TRIGGER.mode }}`\n- Terminal verdict: `${{ ACTIONS.wait_for_rule_application.result.data.verdict }}`\n\nThe sanitized result below records `rule_id`, effective rule revision, `before_verdict`, `after_verdict`, benign tests, correlated `waf_events`, evidence links, cleanup/rollback status, and any error. Missing fields are not treated as success.\n\n```json\n${{ FN.prettify_json(ACTIONS.wait_for_rule_application.result.data) }}\n```"
        }
      }
    ],
    "returns": "${{ ACTIONS.wait_for_rule_application.result.data }}"
  }
}
